WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.309
How do I add a new customer in Field Sales from the dashboard?

2
00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:11.547
From the sidebar, open Customers, then click the Add customer button at the top of the page. The Add new customer dialog appears.

3
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:18.393
In the Basic info section, enter the customer name and the mobile number. These are the two required fields.

4
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:25.224
Fill in any optional details you need, such as the business name, sales channel, city and district.

5
00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:33.078
Finally, click the Add customer button at the bottom of the dialog. The customer is saved and a Customer added message appears.
